sequenceDiagram
  participant D as Data pipeline
  participant T as Training job
  participant E as Eval harness
  participant R as Registry
  participant S as Serving plane
  D->>T: Versioned dataset snapshot
  T->>T: Train, checkpoint to GCS
  T->>E: Final adapter or full weights + run metadata
  E->>E: Golden sets, LLM-as-judge, safety suites
  E->>R: Scorecard attached to model version
  R->>S: Promote as candidate
  S->>S: Argo Rollouts canary 1 percent to 10 to 50 to 100
  S-->>R: Canary SLOs failed, auto-rollback
  S-->>R: Promoted, previous version kept warm
